    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After humanity's fall, when monsters from the depths of space attacked Earth, once-great cities lay in ruins, covered in the ashes of battles and burned hopes. The remnants of humanity unite under a single banner\u2014to liberate Earth from the alien invasion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exodus Core</strong> is a turn-based tactical RPG where you command an elite squad of mechs playing a key role in freeing the planet from alien invaders.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2694\ufe0f Brutal Turn-Based Battles:</strong> Every move counts. Utilize flanking maneuvers, melee and ranged attacks, and your tactical skills to crush superior enemy forces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692020/extras/8a96f2fca030080ae433747e56978d53.poster.avif?t=1749040068\" width=616 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692020/extras/8a96f2fca030080ae433747e56978d53.webm?t=1749040068\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692020/extras/8a96f2fca030080ae433747e56978d53.mp4?t=1749040068\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83e\udd16 Unique Mechs:</strong> Command diverse combat mechs\u2014from heavy assault units to mobile artillery platforms. Each mech is a distinct tactical unit with its own role and unique modifications.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692020/extras/200b16e50746874346b852738be2f013.poster.avif?t=1749040068\" width=616 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692020/extras/200b16e50746874346b852738be2f013.webm?t=1749040068\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692020/extras/200b16e50746874346b852738be2f013.mp4?t=1749040068\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf0c Dark Sci-Fi Atmosphere:</strong> Ruined metropolises, a scorched planet, desperate resistance. The game world is imbued with the spirit of civilization's fall and hope for its restoration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692020/extras/725703b144de2411ff77d03314998526.poster.avif?t=1749040068\" width=616 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692020/extras/725703b144de2411ff77d03314998526.webm?t=1749040068\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692020/extras/725703b144de2411ff77d03314998526.mp4?t=1749040068\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd27 Squad Modification and Customization System:</strong> Rebuild your squad to face new threats: change weapons, reinforce armor, install experimental modules\u2014and survive at any cost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692020/extras/bd8faafe42d5c8e9ea926c8b6dfad329.poster.avif?t=1749040068\" width=616 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692020/extras/bd8faafe42d5c8e9ea926c8b6dfad329.webm?t=1749040068\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692020/extras/bd8faafe42d5c8e9ea926c8b6dfad329.mp4?t=1749040068\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc7d Evolving Alien Enemy:</strong> Enemies are not just targets. They analyze your actions, adapt, and change tactics, turning each mission into a new test of resilience.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After humanity's fall, when monsters from the depths of space attacked Earth, once-great cities lay in ruins, covered in the ashes of battles and burned hopes. The remnants of humanity unite under a single banner\u2014to liberate Earth from the alien invasion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exodus Core</strong> is a turn-based tactical RPG where you command an elite squad of mechs playing a key role in freeing the planet from alien invaders.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2694\ufe0f Brutal Turn-Based Battles:</strong> Every move counts. Utilize flanking maneuvers, melee and ranged attacks, and your tactical skills to crush superior enemy forces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692020/extras/8a96f2fca030080ae433747e56978d53.poster.avif?t=1749040068\" width=616 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692020/extras/8a96f2fca030080ae433747e56978d53.webm?t=1749040068\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692020/extras/8a96f2fca030080ae433747e56978d53.mp4?t=1749040068\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83e\udd16 Unique Mechs:</strong> Command diverse combat mechs\u2014from heavy assault units to mobile artillery platforms. Each mech is a distinct tactical unit with its own role and unique modifications.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692020/extras/200b16e50746874346b852738be2f013.poster.avif?t=1749040068\" width=616 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692020/extras/200b16e50746874346b852738be2f013.webm?t=1749040068\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692020/extras/200b16e50746874346b852738be2f013.mp4?t=1749040068\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf0c Dark Sci-Fi Atmosphere:</strong> Ruined metropolises, a scorched planet, desperate resistance. The game world is imbued with the spirit of civilization's fall and hope for its restoration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692020/extras/725703b144de2411ff77d03314998526.poster.avif?t=1749040068\" width=616 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692020/extras/725703b144de2411ff77d03314998526.webm?t=1749040068\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692020/extras/725703b144de2411ff77d03314998526.mp4?t=1749040068\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd27 Squad Modification and Customization System:</strong> Rebuild your squad to face new threats: change weapons, reinforce armor, install experimental modules\u2014and survive at any cost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692020/extras/bd8faafe42d5c8e9ea926c8b6dfad329.poster.avif?t=1749040068\" width=616 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692020/extras/bd8faafe42d5c8e9ea926c8b6dfad329.webm?t=1749040068\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692020/extras/bd8faafe42d5c8e9ea926c8b6dfad329.mp4?t=1749040068\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc7d Evolving Alien Enemy:</strong> Enemies are not just targets. They analyze your actions, adapt, and change tactics, turning each mission into a new test of resilience.</p></li></ul>",
